AI & Analytics Engineer Internship – Nestlé 
Are you passionate about Artificial Intelligence and Data Analytics? At Nestlé, you’ll have the opportunity to put your knowledge of AI, machine learning, neural networks and analytics into practice within a global and innovative environment. As an AI & Analytics Engineer Intern, you will contribute to shaping Nestlé’s digital future, where technology, innovation and business come together.
Nestlé is the world’s largest food and beverage company, with one clear purpose: 
to unlock the power of food to enhance quality of life for everyone, today and for generations to come.
 With brands like Maggi, KitKat, NESCAFÉ, and Purina, we’re dedicated to sustainability, health, and innovation. Working with us means making an impact on your career, on consumers, and on the world around you.
What will you do?
Starting February 1, 2026, we are looking for an enthusiastic AI & Analytics Engineer Intern to join our Benelux Digital Innovation Team at our head office in Amstelveen.
In this internship, you’ll support the secure and efficient implementation of AI technologies across different business areas helping teams transform data into meaningful insights and digital solutions.
Your main responsibilities include:
Assisting in the development and deployment of AI and Analytics solutions to enhance digital products and services;
Providing functional support regarding AI-systems and Data and Analytics infrastructure;
Ensuring the quality and accuracy of user data within AI-driven applications;
Collaborating with cross-functional teams such as IT, Business Analysts, Compliance, and Security;
Organizing ideation sessions to identify new AI and Analytics use cases;
Reporting directly to the Benelux Digital Innovation Manager.
This is a unique opportunity to experience what it’s like to work as a digital innovator in a multinational environment, collaborating with various teams and gaining exposure to technologies such as cloud computing, web development, and business process automation.
Who are you?
You are analytical, curious and eager to learn. You think in solutions, work accurately, and can explain complex topics clearly to others. You’re proactive, open-minded, and ready to explore new technologies.You bring:
You are currently enrolled in a Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Computer Science, Artificial Intelligence, Data Science or a related field;
Ideally, you have 1–2 years of academic or project experience in AI or analytics;
Knowledge of machine learning, neural networks and natural language processing;
Strong analytical and communication skills and the ability to work well in teams;
Fluency in English (Dutch and/or French is a plus);
A keen interest in AI, analytics, e-commerce, and cloud or web technologies.
Eager to learn about e-commerce, cloud, and web technologies
What We Offer You
This internship offers more than just a challenge:
A full-time internship (40 hours per week) for 5–6 months;
10 vacation days based on a 5-month internship;
An internship allowance of €800 per month (based on full-time);
Reimbursement of travel expenses;
Good food, good life: enjoy daily free fruit and healthy meals;
A work laptop;
A Nestlé Internship Training Plan focused on your personal development;
A pleasant, informal working environment with friendly colleagues and social activities;
A close-knit intern community with fun events and activities. 
And finally
Respect is at the heart of Nestlé's culture, of which room for differences is an important part. Differences between people who buy our products and in our workplace. We believe it is important that everyone feels welcome and safe at Nestlé. We are convinced that diversity leads to more creativity and innovation and moves our organization forward. So, are you just as excited as we are? Apply now!
Any questions?
Our recruiters are ready to answer your questions. Send your question to careers@nl.nestle.com and you will receive an answer within 3 days.

